msgid "DNS second opinion"
msgstr "Segona opinió DNS"

#: includes/class-tso-lc-http.php
msgid ""
"When this server cannot resolve a domain, ask Cloudflare public DNS "
"(cloudflare-dns.com) before reporting \"Domain does not exist\". If "
"Cloudflare resolves it, the link is shown as OK. Only the hostname is sent. "
"Without this option, such links are shown as \"not resolved by this server "
"(unconfirmed)\" and are not counted as broken."
msgstr ""
"Quan aquest servidor no pot resoldre un domini, consulta el DNS públic de "
"Cloudflare (cloudflare-dns.com) abans d'informar que \"El domini no "
"existeix\". Si Cloudflare el resol, l'enllaç es mostra com a OK. Només "
"s'envia el nom d'amfitrió. Sense aquesta opció, aquests enllaços es mostren "
"com a \"no resolt per aquest servidor (no confirmat)\" i no es compten com a"
" trencats."

